>  But I added 2 user font ttf files from same family but different weight (regular in one and semi-bold in the other). I just see the single select entry for the font family. Is this expected?

usually if two files have same font family name are shown as one file, this happens also with text editors the weight will be managed internally (then automatically choose the right file when needed)

> Also when I stop a video I am getting an exception thrown in ~CDVDSubtitlesLibass() in ass_renderer_done(m_renderer);

if you have build kodi as debug you have to manually put in kodi directory the libass debug files (should be contained in the kodi lib package) otherwise will crash, or as alternative you have to manually build libass lib as debug,

I have integrated user fonts cache building at Kodi start-up, and deleted the two threads workaroud to half loading times in the hope of using in the future the parallels c++ features
@enen92 i think more or less this is what you meant

